---
import Slide from '../ui/Slide.astro';
import Lifecycle from '../ui/Lifecycle.astro';
import Callout from '../ui/Callout.astro';
---

<Slide
  id="s04b-lifecycle-steps"
  chapter="Mindset"
  title="What Each Step Means"
  notes="Quick definitions. Emphasize hypothesis in Narrow and evidence in Verify."
>
  <div class="stagger flex flex-col gap-8">
    <Lifecycle class="justify-center" />
    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-deck-border bg-deck-panel p-5">
        <div class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-deck-cyan">Observe</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base text-deck-muted">Events, metrics, symptoms — don’t change yet.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-deck-border bg-deck-panel p-5">
        <div class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-deck-cyan">Locate</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base text-deck-muted">Which layer failed: infra → app?</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-deck-border bg-deck-panel p-5">
        <div class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-deck-cyan">Narrow</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base text-deck-muted">Hypothesis — eliminate options.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-deck-border bg-deck-panel p-5">
        <div class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-deck-cyan">Verify</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base text-deck-muted">Prove root cause with evidence.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-deck-border bg-deck-panel p-5">
        <div class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-deck-amber">Fix</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base text-deck-muted">Smallest change for the root cause.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-deck-border bg-deck-panel p-5">
        <div class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-deck-amber">Validate</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base text-deck-muted">Users, SLOs, downstream deps OK?</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-deck-border bg-deck-panel p-5 sm:col-span-2">
        <div class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-deck-amber">Prevent</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base text-deck-muted">Alerts, runbooks, tests — so this class can’t recur silently.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Callout type="rule">Never skip Observe on a failure you’ve never seen before.</Callout>
  </div>
</Slide>
